  "geminiNoteSends": "Gemini does not get your database. It asks tools that run on your phone or computer for the figures it needs, and what travels is their answers: your totals by category and by month, what is free until payday, your subscriptions, your savings goal, your accounts with their balances and, when the question calls for it, a month's largest payments with their merchants.",
